,"text":"The Argument With The Sky discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":283,"player":1,"text":"Fire and cold were each mastered separately and immediately turned on each other. The weather has held a grudge ever since.","kind":"info"},{"turn":283,"player":1,"text":"Now buildable: The Argument With The Sky.","kind":"good"},{"turn":283,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch sells its Chapel of Mild Optimism to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":283,"player":1,"text":"Research begins: See the World.","kind":"research"},{"turn":283,"player":0,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram has begun The Argument With The Sky in Fairhaven. There is only one: build it first, or not at all.","kind":"info","cue":"folly-race","at":[34,35]},{"turn":283,"player":1,"text":"Work has begun on The Argument With The Sky in Fairhaven. There is only one, and everybody now knows we want it.","kind":"good","cue":"folly-race","at":[34,35]},{"turn":284,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind completes Totem of Managed Feelings.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":284,"player":1,"text":"Silverbrook sells its Chapel of Mild Optimism to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":285,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth completes Orc.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":285,"player":0,"text":"Mudhole completes Death Knight.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":285,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind sells its Totem of Managed Feelings to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":285,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch completes Chapel of Mild Optimism.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":285,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch sells its Chapel of Mild Optimism to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":286,"player":0,"text":"Grimtooth completes Orc.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":286,"player":0,"text":"Definitely Not Mudhole completes Axethrower.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":286,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew sells its Goblin Treasury to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":286,"player":0,"text":"The Bleeding Skull Horde and The Radiant Kingdom of Bram renew their peace for another 20 turns. The Bleeding Skull Horde pays 25 gold for the privilege.","kind":"good","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":286,"player":1,"text":"The Bleeding Skull Horde and The Radiant Kingdom of Bram renew their peace for another 20 turns. The Bleeding Skull Horde pays 25 gold for the privilege.","kind":"good","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":286,"player":1,"text":"Peasant finishes Tidy Furrows.","kind":"good","at":[37,30]},{"turn":286,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch completes Chapel of Mild Optimism.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":286,"player":1,"text":"Thornwall completes Ballista.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":286,"player":0,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tear up the road.","kind":"bad","at":[37,6]},{"turn":286,"player":1,"text":"The Radiant Kingdom of Bram tear up the road.","kind":"info","at":[37,6]},{"turn":287,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew sells its Totem of Managed Feelings to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":288,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind completes Totem of Managed Feelings.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":288,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":288,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew completes Totem of Managed Feelings.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":288,"player":0,"text":"Stabhaven grows to 4.","kind":"growth","cue":"growth"},{"turn":288,"player":0,"text":"Skullgrind sells its Totem of Managed Feelings to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":288,"player":1,"text":"Aldenwatch sells its Chapel of Mild Optimism to cover the books.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":289,"player":0,"text":"Somebody Knocked discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":289,"player":0,"text":"Something under the ground knocked. An orc knocked back. Neither of them has been able to stop since.","kind":"info"},{"turn":289,"player":0,"text":"Now buildable: The Knocking Stones, The Pit of Offerings, The Demonic Portal.","kind":"good"},{"turn":289,"p